WEBVTT

00:12.340 --> 00:14.220
I was able to interview Robert,

00:14.300 --> 00:18.140
a private under Romanov's command
during the Arizona Campaign,

00:18.220 --> 00:21.640
but as you can see,
it wasn't much of a conversation.

00:22.600 --> 00:25.560
Unfortunately, he isn't fit to testify.

00:28.400 --> 00:30.900
I had the Public Security-issued pass,

00:30.980 --> 00:33.650
but you can see why I found him so easily.

00:33.740 --> 00:38.530
Tomorrow I'll dig into his time
working at Hesner before he came here.

00:38.620 --> 00:39.700
Talk to you later.

00:40.620 --> 00:42.870
--Well, that was a waste.
--Yeah.

00:42.960 --> 00:45.920
But the fact that she's
all right and no one has interfered

00:46.000 --> 00:48.330
does point to something:

00:48.420 --> 00:52.090
that either the enemy is
confident there's no evidence left

00:52.170 --> 00:58.090
or that Romanov's system
might not be monolithic after all.

02:40.990 --> 02:43.120
Hey, new guy. Our stop's next.

02:43.200 --> 02:44.200
Right.

03:20.650 --> 03:22.860
An original OSI, huh?

03:29.450 --> 03:31.790
Is there anywhere to run to?

03:31.870 --> 03:34.170
Okakura prepared them for us.

03:34.250 --> 03:36.880
This place isn't safe anymore, either.

03:36.960 --> 03:40.460
I'm going to turn myself in to the police.

03:40.550 --> 03:44.840
Can you honestly trust the police-- no-- the GGP?

03:44.930 --> 03:49.970
I can't. My brother and father both hate the GGP.

03:50.060 --> 03:52.440
I have no intentions of handing you over to them.

03:54.480 --> 03:58.070
The march will proceed to
the Peace Memorial Park as planned.

03:59.150 --> 04:03.400
Those aboard RideBacks,
please finish the registration process.

04:03.490 --> 04:08.450
There won't be any breaks during the march, so...

04:08.540 --> 04:10.700
Doesn't this seem a little too merry?

04:10.790 --> 04:12.750
It's to be expected.

04:12.830 --> 04:17.250
Not many have been arrested yet
or had their RideBacks taken away.

04:17.340 --> 04:20.210
Plus, today is about preventing it in the first place.

04:20.300 --> 04:22.090
I'm going to do my very best!

04:22.170 --> 04:25.130
I'm going to show that
the RideBacks and Rin are innocent!

04:25.220 --> 04:28.970
That's nice and all, but you're
paying us for the Balon if it gets seized.

04:29.060 --> 04:31.600
What?! That's not fair!

04:31.680 --> 04:35.560
Don't get too crazy.
Let's let "safety first" be our motto!

04:35.650 --> 04:36.600
Right!

04:37.480 --> 04:38.940
What's that?

04:39.020 --> 04:43.440
A good luck charm. It's a photo
Shoko gave me of Rin performing.

04:44.450 --> 04:49.700
We're starting the protest march!
All participants, please gather here!

04:50.080 --> 04:51.930
Civilian traffic is restricted

04:54.080 --> 04:55.410
What's your cargo?

04:55.500 --> 04:56.790
Art.

04:57.830 --> 04:59.210
A pass?

04:59.290 --> 05:00.590
Just a moment.

05:11.060 --> 05:13.930
You sure about that pass?

05:14.020 --> 05:15.350
It should work.

05:15.440 --> 05:18.020
Hey! Open up the back!

05:18.110 --> 05:20.060
What are you doing?! Hurry it up!

05:20.150 --> 05:21.610
This isn't good...

05:21.690 --> 05:24.820
No, it's all right! It checks out!

05:24.900 --> 05:26.110
Thanks!

05:33.000 --> 05:36.960
Just what I'd expect from Nanpu Kataoka.
He's got some good connections!

05:37.040 --> 05:38.330
You can come out now.

05:40.170 --> 05:43.210
Should we really be in
the middle of the city like this?

05:43.300 --> 05:47.840
Hide a tree in a forest,
a person in the middle of downtown.

05:47.930 --> 05:50.430
Plus you want to see the others, don't you?

05:50.510 --> 05:51.850
The others?

05:51.930 --> 05:55.600
They're helping protest against the GGP today.

05:55.680 --> 05:57.980
We're supposed to meet up afterward.

05:58.060 --> 05:59.190
Even Shoko?!

05:59.270 --> 06:01.190
She's not participating in the protest,

06:01.270 --> 06:03.480
but Hishida said she'd come by afterward.

06:03.570 --> 06:05.230
They left you a message.

06:09.570 --> 06:11.160
Okay, we're recording!

06:11.240 --> 06:12.580
I'm so glad, Rin!

06:12.660 --> 06:15.450
I wouldn't know what to do
if anything happened to you!

06:15.540 --> 06:16.950
Go on, Shoko!

06:17.040 --> 06:19.790
Rin! How are you?! I'm doing okay!

06:19.880 --> 06:22.630
I was really worried,
but I was relieved when I saw your video!

06:22.710 --> 06:24.090
Come back soon, okay?!

06:24.170 --> 06:27.420
We can't send a large video
over e-mail, so try to make it quick.

06:27.510 --> 06:32.260
I learned how to ride better!
I want to ride with you sometime!

06:32.350 --> 06:33.930
Oh, I said it!

06:34.010 --> 06:36.970
C'mon, you're taking too long! Hurry and--

06:41.480 --> 06:43.440
Thanks, everyone...

06:47.240 --> 06:50.070
We believe the BMA's next
targets will be government offices

06:50.160 --> 06:53.870
and major transportation hubs such as train stations.

06:53.950 --> 06:56.830
We now have all main roads locked down,

06:56.910 --> 06:59.710
but we have instructed the police
to commence the door-to-door search

06:59.790 --> 07:03.750
based on the assumption that
they have already infiltrated the city.

07:04.540 --> 07:08.340
We've also confirmed anti-GGP activities

07:08.420 --> 07:11.430
centered around Representative Nanpu Kataoka.

07:12.300 --> 07:14.050
We've requested that he be arrested

07:14.140 --> 07:16.100
for violating the Anti-Terrorism
Peace Preservation Law, but...

07:17.560 --> 07:22.940
Umm... Colonel Romanov.
Nanpu is Ryunosuke Kataoka's father...

07:24.650 --> 07:26.270
Just do what you have to.

07:31.320 --> 07:32.860
How did it go?

07:32.950 --> 07:37.280
The military's system is
on a fully-independent network.

07:37.370 --> 07:39.500
Breaking in from the outside is out of the question.

07:39.580 --> 07:41.500
Our next operation will fail

07:41.580 --> 07:44.420
unless we neutralize the enemy's MEADS system.

07:44.500 --> 07:46.590
I take it you found something?

07:46.670 --> 07:52.090
The network uses a proprietary
Harvard architecture protocol,

07:52.180 --> 07:54.340
making the system nearly impossible to hack.

07:56.140 --> 07:59.180
But I can stop it temporarily

07:59.270 --> 08:02.350
by spoofing hardly-used machine IDs

08:02.440 --> 08:06.900
and sending a deluge of packets
to overload the network traffic.

08:06.980 --> 08:08.820
It'll take time, though.

08:16.450 --> 08:20.790
Mind if I ask what this mission's true objective is?

08:20.870 --> 08:24.120
You promised to obey me with no questions asked.

08:27.040 --> 08:29.550
I'll tell you as an old friend.

08:29.630 --> 08:32.210
You're right that this operation is a fake.

08:32.300 --> 08:34.380
You're not going to fight seriously?

08:34.470 --> 08:36.550
A fight is always serious.

08:36.640 --> 08:42.350
But, as you say, there are
many people with separate objectives.

08:42.430 --> 08:44.850
I think I know what your objective is.

08:44.940 --> 08:49.020
I haven't necessarily forgiven his betrayal either.

08:49.110 --> 08:52.030
Inside the burning ICBM site, I swore revenge

08:52.110 --> 08:54.650
against the man who framed me.

08:54.740 --> 08:57.780
I won't burn that scum alive.

08:57.870 --> 08:59.780
I'm going to knock him off his pedestal

08:59.870 --> 09:02.450
and kill him while he's filled with despair.

09:03.960 --> 09:07.710
What about you? Why did you
build the Fuego? For Rin Ogata's sake?

09:08.670 --> 09:10.920
No. It's only a pathetic, lingering attachment I have

09:11.000 --> 09:13.300
after abandoning the battlefield.

09:13.380 --> 09:14.920
She has nothing to do with it.

09:15.010 --> 09:18.090
But she now knows the strength...

09:18.180 --> 09:21.760
...she can control under the extreme strain

09:21.850 --> 09:25.230
of having bullets fly by
and being surrounded by flames.

09:29.480 --> 09:34.190
She's just an 18-year-old girl.
She doesn't need such talents.

09:38.240 --> 09:42.450
If there hadn't been
a terrorist attack there that day...

09:42.540 --> 09:46.120
If I hadn't broken through the GGP security net...

09:46.210 --> 09:48.620
Through with RideBacks now?

09:48.710 --> 09:50.630
It's not that.

09:50.710 --> 09:55.920
I just wish I could've had
a normal experience with them, like you.

09:57.630 --> 10:01.300
That's the Third National Theater, isn't it?

10:01.390 --> 10:03.890
That's the kind of place you really belong.

10:05.640 --> 10:08.020
It's far beyond my reach now.

10:08.100 --> 10:11.360
You give up too easily, you know that?

10:11.440 --> 10:14.820
We're the same in that we're
never happy unless we're the best,

10:14.900 --> 10:17.360
but I don't like how you abandon everything so easily.

10:18.150 --> 10:20.320
You left this on the Fuego, didn't you?

10:20.410 --> 10:22.830
I'm not telling you to ride RideBacks.

10:22.910 --> 10:26.410
But I gave you the EW band
as a symbol of being a club member.

10:26.500 --> 10:31.080
You're still in my club,
so I won't allow you to act selfishly.

10:31.170 --> 10:33.000
Tamayo...

10:33.920 --> 10:37.300
Get out of our country, GGP!

10:37.380 --> 10:39.300
Get out!

10:40.510 --> 10:45.680
The police can't do anything
rough with this many people here.

10:45.770 --> 10:48.230
How are you holding up, Suzuri?

10:48.310 --> 10:50.520
I've calmed down a lot.

10:50.600 --> 10:52.980
I guess you're not one for stage fright.

10:53.060 --> 10:56.980
--What's the matter?
--That's the Third National Theater.

10:57.070 --> 10:58.990
That's where Rin used to dance!

10:59.070 --> 11:02.410
Wow, it's really big!

11:02.490 --> 11:06.410
To be honest, I'd much rather
see Rin dancing on the stage

11:06.490 --> 11:08.410
than on a RideBack.

11:08.500 --> 11:13.040
But she would hate me if she ever heard me say that!

11:13.130 --> 11:14.710
You think so?

11:14.790 --> 11:18.460
It hurts her more than anyone
that she can't dance anymore.

11:18.550 --> 11:22.970
Hmm. I don't know the dancing side of Rin,

11:23.050 --> 11:26.140
but I think she was able to dance
with the Fuego because she did ballet.

11:26.220 --> 11:30.020
Conversely, dancing with
the Fuego might even help with ballet.

11:30.100 --> 11:34.060
I'm sure Rin would be
a success if she went back to ballet!

11:34.150 --> 11:37.780
Yeah. She could probably succeed at anything she does.

11:37.860 --> 11:42.110
It's possible she's only given up
because she needs to sort things out first.

11:42.200 --> 11:46.330
So I think a good friend would
tell her something once the time is right.

11:46.410 --> 11:49.700
You and Shoko are her friends, right?

11:49.790 --> 11:53.790
Yeah. We're on good terms,
but not real friends like you.

11:53.880 --> 11:57.130
Hishida's always being blunt
with me, even though he's my junior.

11:57.210 --> 12:00.800
But I need time to get ready to be Rin's friend...!

12:00.880 --> 12:03.590
You don't need time to be friends!

12:03.680 --> 12:08.260
Yeah. In our eyes,
you're already really close friends.

12:11.020 --> 12:13.310
Hey! Are you the RideBack girl?!

12:13.400 --> 12:14.230
Huh?

12:14.310 --> 12:15.900
You are, aren't you?!

12:15.980 --> 12:18.730
No, I'm not her at all...!

12:18.820 --> 12:22.400
--I'm a big fan!
--I am too!

12:22.490 --> 12:23.400
I knew it!

12:23.490 --> 12:27.280
Hey! The mystery RideBack girl is here!

12:28.200 --> 12:31.200
--Seriously?!
--She is?! Where?! Where?!

12:31.290 --> 12:34.290
Huh? Huh?! N-No, I'm not her...!

12:38.210 --> 12:40.170
Okay, I leave the rest to you.

12:44.050 --> 12:45.220
Let's go, Ogata.

12:45.300 --> 12:49.220
It appears that Nanpu Kataoka,
head of the ruling party's largest faction,

12:49.310 --> 12:51.220
was just arrested.

12:51.310 --> 12:56.150
Representative Kataoka was arrested
in the hospital where he is staying,

12:56.230 --> 12:59.980
for aiding the terrorist activities
of anti-GGP organizations.

13:05.200 --> 13:09.120
In short, the combat capabilities of these Grimoires

13:09.200 --> 13:13.000
are on par with even the most highly-trained riders.

13:14.080 --> 13:18.170
And to think that the perfect
opponent is about to come to us...

13:28.180 --> 13:29.760
A police RideBack!

13:37.310 --> 13:38.980
The protest march isn't over yet...

13:40.230 --> 13:44.360
The fight's just begun, everyone!
Raise your voices and be heard!

13:47.740 --> 13:50.740
They say the RideBack girl is back in action...

13:50.830 --> 13:54.080
--The terrorist that escaped the GGP...?!
--Isn't this dangerous?!

13:54.160 --> 13:56.500
She's just a small girl...!

13:59.250 --> 14:01.840
What do we do?
She's attracting a lot of attention...

14:01.920 --> 14:04.380
It's almost time for us to meet up.

14:04.460 --> 14:07.380
This train will be stopped at this
station for approximately five minutes

14:07.470 --> 14:09.890
in order to conduct terrorism-prevention checks.

14:09.970 --> 14:14.060
We apologize for the inconvenience, but...

14:14.140 --> 14:15.520
It's like cat and mouse.

14:16.850 --> 14:19.140
I'll get to see everyone again soon...

14:20.310 --> 14:24.440
Uhh, you're not going to your father's hospital?

14:24.530 --> 14:26.990
Help keep an eye on the protest.

14:28.320 --> 14:30.700
Mr. Kataoka. The chief wants to see you.

14:34.120 --> 14:36.370
We have the RideBack girl with us!

14:36.450 --> 14:41.080
--Yeah! We're not afraid of anything!
--Yeah! Yeah!

14:45.920 --> 14:49.380
Suzuri! It's time to come back!

14:49.470 --> 14:51.930
No good. She can't hear me.

14:52.010 --> 14:53.970
Hey, Hishida. Look...!

14:55.810 --> 14:58.930
--Police RideBacks!
--The GGP, too.

14:59.020 --> 15:00.520
This doesn't look good...

15:02.900 --> 15:07.690
We have word that Rin Ogata
is aboard a RideBack at the protest.

15:10.200 --> 15:11.030
Is that her?

15:11.110 --> 15:15.080
Command vehicle to all units. A wanted
criminal is among the demonstrators.

15:15.160 --> 15:18.660
Target is aboard a RideBack
and may attempt to flee or resist.

15:18.750 --> 15:19.960
Level 4 standby.

15:20.040 --> 15:21.000
Understood.

15:22.790 --> 15:26.300
--They're taking action!
--They think they're high and mighty!

15:26.380 --> 15:29.840
Get out of our country, GGP!

15:29.920 --> 15:31.800
We won't let you have your way!

15:31.880 --> 15:34.970
--What are you doing?! Leave!
--Get outta here!

15:35.050 --> 15:36.850
Maybe we should run...?

15:36.930 --> 15:37.890
They're coming!

15:40.810 --> 15:44.610
The check has been completed.
We will depart shortly.

15:49.570 --> 15:53.160
It must be rough, having
a family full of suspected criminals.

15:53.240 --> 15:54.780
Why are you here?

15:55.660 --> 15:58.040
Did you find out about Colonel Romanov's past?

15:59.370 --> 16:01.750
The GGP is aging.

16:01.830 --> 16:05.040
He represents the old status quo that loved war.

16:05.130 --> 16:06.500
Get to the point.

16:06.590 --> 16:09.460
I will take care of the issue with your father.

16:09.550 --> 16:12.720
In exchange, there's something I want you to do.

16:14.090 --> 16:18.010
Expose the Hesner Company. Using only your resources.

16:18.100 --> 16:21.220
Who do you think you are?
Do you think I'll bow to threats?

16:21.310 --> 16:25.850
This is a deal. The embodiment
of a new order needs drama.

16:25.940 --> 16:30.150
Those who step onto the stage
need a role and compensation.

16:30.230 --> 16:32.440
And you fit the qualifications.

16:35.370 --> 16:36.950
A pulse police stick!

16:40.290 --> 16:42.750
Hishida! Do something!

16:42.830 --> 16:44.120
Do what?!

16:44.210 --> 16:45.120
Run!

16:48.840 --> 16:50.840
Suzuri! Get away from there!

16:50.920 --> 16:52.300
Hishida?!

16:58.010 --> 16:59.430
She's leaving the park?!

17:02.980 --> 17:07.560
Unit #1 . Target is on a public street.
Pull it over for violating traffic law!

17:07.650 --> 17:08.610
Understood!

17:18.120 --> 17:20.910
Rin! And Tamayo!

17:29.040 --> 17:30.500
Suzuri?

17:30.590 --> 17:32.170
Rin!

17:34.380 --> 17:37.550
Unit #1 is closing in. Unit #2, cut her off!

17:37.640 --> 17:38.590
Understood!

17:40.810 --> 17:42.350
That idiot!

17:42.430 --> 17:44.980
Suzuri! Stop!

17:45.810 --> 17:47.140
They're coming this way!

17:47.230 --> 17:48.400
The Balon...

17:48.480 --> 17:49.480
Suzuri?

17:51.440 --> 17:52.820
She's being chased...?

18:00.530 --> 18:01.950
They've cut her off!

18:02.030 --> 18:03.450
No! Stop!

18:04.080 --> 18:07.750
Rin! Umm, please take up dancing again!

18:07.830 --> 18:11.170
I want to see you perform!

18:11.250 --> 18:13.040
What, Suzuri?!

18:19.680 --> 18:25.140
<i>Watch, Rin! See how much</i>
<i>I've improved while you were gone!</i>

18:26.020 --> 18:27.350
<i>I'm going to leap, too!</i>

18:34.440 --> 18:35.400
No...

19:19.400 --> 19:21.910
Suzuri...! No...!

19:41.260 --> 19:42.430
This can't be real...

19:44.640 --> 19:57.230
This can't be real...
This can't be real... This can't be real...

19:58.400 --> 20:01.740
No!

20:43.990 --> 20:46.240
I see. All right.

20:46.320 --> 20:49.530
Thanks. I'll call you later.

21:12.520 --> 21:15.310
S-Suzuri is...

21:18.310 --> 21:19.480
Ogata...

21:20.320 --> 21:25.780
If you... If you hadn't built
this stupid thing, Suzuri would still be...

21:25.860 --> 21:29.820
Suzuri would still be...!

21:35.920 --> 21:37.040
Ogata...

21:40.710 --> 21:42.210
It's a lingering attachment...

21:44.170 --> 21:48.050
...yours and mine...

21:48.140 --> 21:51.930
Our lingering attachment killed Suzuri...!

21:56.730 --> 22:01.400
Even when he laughs

22:03.400 --> 22:08.990
I'm thinking of you before I realize it

22:12.030 --> 22:17.040
And the hands holding his

22:18.830 --> 22:24.300
feel your warmth, too

22:26.470 --> 22:30.220
Even if I cut out my recollections

22:30.300 --> 22:34.180
and drive them out of my heart

22:34.270 --> 22:37.930
or try to kick the memories out

22:38.020 --> 22:42.400
I still think of you

22:42.480 --> 22:46.900
Time now passes and seasons fly by

22:46.990 --> 22:50.740
Even if that smile starts to become hazy

22:50.820 --> 22:54.740
my heart will never forget you

22:54.830 --> 22:58.500
(even if we can never meet again)

22:58.580 --> 23:02.330
Even if I knock over photos of us smiling

23:02.420 --> 23:06.760
or try to hide my overflowing feelings

23:07.720 --> 23:10.970
my heart will never forget

23:11.680 --> 23:14.930
my memories with you

23:25.980 --> 23:40.980
New New Hishida Theatre

23:35.830 --> 23:39.520
Next Episode:

23:35.830 --> 23:39.520
Cloudy Followed by Occasional Rain...
